 - JEPI","docCategory":"Regulatory Documents (US APAC) ; Legal Documents (EMEA) ; Financial Report (APAC based on product type)","childDoc":null,"description":"JPMorgan Equity Premium Income ETF-ETF Shares Semi Annual Report","onDate":"2026-09-19T07:09:19.781-0400"},{"documentType":"Summary Prospectus","docURL":"https://am.jpmorgan.com/JPMorgan/TVT/46641Q332/SP?site=JPMorganv3","isGlassDoor":false,"isProtected":false,"language":"en","title":"Summary Prospectus - JEPI","docCategory":"Regulatory Documents (US APAC) ; Legal Documents (EMEA) ; Financial Report (APAC based on product type)","childDoc":null,"description":"JPMorgan Equity Premium Income ETF-ETF Shares Summary Prospectus","onDate":"2026-09-19T07:09:19.781-0400"},{"documentType":"XBRL","docURL":"https://am.jpmorgan.com/JPMorgan/TVT/46641Q332/XBRL?site=JPMorganv3","isGlassDoor":false,"isProtected":false,"language":"en","title":"XBRL - JEPI","docCategory":"Regulatory Documents (US APAC) ; Legal Documents (EMEA) ; Financial Report (APAC based on product type)","childDoc":null,"description":"JPMorgan Equity Premium Income ETF-ETF Shares XBRL","onDate":"2026-09-19T07:09:19.781-0400"}]};
